{"title":"Iron bloom","sourceTitle":"Iron bloom/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Iron_bloom/de\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Eisenluppe (16% translated)\" lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">Deutsch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Iron_bloom\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Iron bloom (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Iron_bloom/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Lupas de forja (8% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Iron_bloom/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Loupe ferreuse (8% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Iron_bloom/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Крица (100% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Iron_bloom/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"铁坯 (76% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Ferro impuro</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ironbloom.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/4/41/Ironbloom.png/100px-Ironbloom.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/41/Ironbloom.png/150px-Ironbloom.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/41/Ironbloom.png/200px-Ironbloom.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p><b>Iron blooms</b> são produzidos pela fusão de <a href=\"/Iron/pt-br\" title=\"Iron/pt-br\">iron ore</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Iron/pt-br\" title=\"Iron/pt-br\"> </a></span> (hematita, magnetita ou limonita) em um <a href=\"/Bloomery/pt-br\" title=\"Bloomery/pt-br\">bloomery</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bloomery/pt-br\" title=\"Bloomery/pt-br\"> </a></span> e são um precursor para lingotes de ferro.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Criação\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Criação</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Ores\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ores</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Coletando_minério_de_ferro\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Coletando minério de ferro</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Bloomery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Bloomery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Usando_flores\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Usando flores</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Wrought_iron\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Wrought iron</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Vídeo_tutorial\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Vídeo tutorial</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"clear:both;\">\n<p><span id=\"Creation\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Cria.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Criação\">Criação</span></h2>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ores\">Ores</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<dl><dd><i>See also: <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Iron\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Iron\">Iron</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Iron\" title=\"Iron\"> </a></span></i></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h3><span id=\"Coletando_min.C3.A9rio_de_ferro\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Coletando_minério_de_ferro\">Coletando minério de ferro</span></h3>\n<p>Existem 3 minérios de ferro não meteórico: hematita, magnetita e limonita. Cada minério surge em diferentes tipos de rocha, mas no total, os minérios de ferro podem ser encontrados em qualquer tipo de rocha, exceto arenito e bauxita. Tal como acontece com a maioria dos minérios, uma das melhores maneiras de encontrar minério de ferro é usar um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Prospecting_pick\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Prospecting pick\">prospecting pick</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Prospecting_pick\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prospecting pick\"> </a></span> no modo de pesquisa de densidade para encontrar uma alta concentração e, em seguida, escavar uma escada vertical descendente. Devido à forma como os minérios são gerados como discos planos, os poços de prospecção verticais são mais eficientes do que os horizontais. Uma escolha <a href=\"/Bronze/pt-br\" title=\"Bronze/pt-br\">bronze</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bronze/pt-br\" title=\"Bronze/pt-br\"> </a></span> ou melhor é necessária para extrair minério de ferro.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>A tier 3 <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Pickaxe\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Pickaxe\">pickaxe</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pickaxe\" title=\"Pickaxe\"> </a></span> (<a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bronze\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bronze\">bronze</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bronze\" title=\"Bronze\"> </a></span> or higher) or an <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ore_blasting_bomb\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ore blasting bomb\">ore blasting bomb</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ore_blasting_bomb\" title=\"Ore blasting bomb\"> </a></span> is required to mine iron ores.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bloomery\">Bloomery</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<dl><dd><i>See also: <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bloomery\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bloomery\">Bloomery</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bloomery\" title=\"Bloomery\"> </a></span></i></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>Due to its high melting point, iron ore cannot be smelted in a <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/crucible\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/crucible\">crucible</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Crucible\" title=\"Crucible\"> </a></span>. Instead, it is processed into iron blooms in a <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bloomery\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bloomery\">bloomery</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bloomery\" title=\"Bloomery\"> </a></span>, a small structure made of <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Fire_clay\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Fire clay\">fireclay bricks</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fire_clay\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fire clay\"> </a></span> that is capable of reaching extremely high temperatures.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usando_flores\">Usando flores</span></h3>\n<p>Para criar flores de ferro, coloque pepitas de minério de ferro dentro de uma flor. Bloomeries podem conter até 120 pepitas e produzirão 1 flor de ferro para cada 20 pepitas de minério de ferro, portanto, um máximo de 6 flores de ferro se 120 pepitas forem usadas. As Bloomeries devem ser aquecidas com combustível que atinja pelo menos 1200°C, como <a href=\"/Charcoal/pt-br\" title=\"Charcoal/pt-br\">charcoal</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Charcoal/pt-br\" title=\"Charcoal/pt-br\"> </a></span>, antracite ou preto <a href=\"/Coal/pt-br\" title=\"Coal/pt-br\">coal</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Coal/pt-br\" title=\"Coal/pt-br\"> </a></span>. Assim que a flor terminar de queimar, destrua-a para revelar as flores de ferro dentro dela.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Wrought_iron\">Wrought iron</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<dl><dd><i>See also: <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Smithing\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Smithing\">Forja</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Smithing\" title=\"Smithing\"> </a></span></i></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>Iron blooms can only be refined into iron ingots; when placed on an anvil, no dialog box to select an item will appear. An iron bloom requires a tier 2 <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Anvil\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Anvil\">anvil</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Anvil\" title=\"Anvil\"> </a></span> (<a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bronze\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bronze\">bronze</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bronze\" title=\"Bronze\"> </a></span> or higher) and has a workable temperature of 700°C.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Para transformar uma flor de ferro em um lingote de ferro, ela deve ser trabalhada em um <a href=\"/Anvil/pt-br\" title=\"Anvil/pt-br\">anvil</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Anvil/pt-br\" title=\"Anvil/pt-br\"> </a></span> (camada de bronze ou melhor) usando um martelo. O Bloom deve estar quente e, se necessário, pode ser reaquecido em <a href=\"/Forge/pt-br\" title=\"Forge/pt-br\">forge</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Forge/pt-br\" title=\"Forge/pt-br\"> </a></span>, semelhante aos lingotes metálicos.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Trabalhar uma flor de ferro consiste em remover a camada de óxido (voxels de cor mais escura) e mover os voxels de ferro para a posição. A remoção do óxido geralmente remove vários voxels de uma vez. Freqüentemente, sobrarão voxels de ferro em excesso após a modelagem do lingote - divida-os para finalizar o processo de trabalho.\nAs flores de ferro têm alguma variabilidade em tamanho e forma, mas são em sua maioria semelhantes.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p><a href=\"/Helve_hammer/pt-br\" title=\"Helve hammer/pt-br\">Helve hammers</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Helve_hammer/pt-br\" title=\"Helve hammer/pt-br\"> </a></span> pode ser usado para automatizar o processo de refino. Uma placa de ferro quente colocada sob um martelo helve será lentamente transformada em um lingote.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n</div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r285111\">.mw-parser-output .history th[scope=col]{background-color:#5E462A;color:#EAD3B3;border:2px solid #382b1e;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .history td{border:transparent}.mw-parser-output .history th[scope=row]{background-color:#D1B296;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .history tr:nth-child(2n/**/+1) td{background-color:#CCBCAB}.mw-parser-output .history tr:nth-child(2n) td{background-color:#E0CFBB}</style>\n<strong class=\"error\"><span class=\"scribunto-error mw-scribunto-error-112edf4d\">Lua error in Module:History at line 30: attempt to index local &#39;version&#39; (a nil value).</span></strong><table class=\"wikitable history\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\">Versão\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Descrição\n</th></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span id=\"Video&#95;tutorials\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h2><span id=\"V.C3.ADdeo_tutorial\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Vídeo_tutorial\">Vídeo tutorial</span></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">How To Smelt Iron Bloom &amp; Forge Iron Ingots</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div style=\"width: 400px; height:240px;\" class=\"ext-YouTube-video ext-YouTu